    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Laserboy VR is a thrilling virtual reality experience. Armed with powerful laser weapons and the unique ability to slow down time, players must battle waves of enemies across a variety of visually stunning and immersive arenas.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Laserboy VR delivers an exhilarating experience enjoyable for all skill levels.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wield Powerful Laser Weapons</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379190/extras/21f44b1381eb580bb9aa06021316520e.poster.avif?t=1745848299\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379190/extras/21f44b1381eb580bb9aa06021316520e.webm?t=1745848299\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379190/extras/21f44b1381eb580bb9aa06021316520e.mp4?t=1745848299\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Slow-Down Time</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the game by slowing down time!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect Power-Ups</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Super-shot (increased firepower)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shield (360<strong>\u00b0 </strong>cover<strong>)</strong>\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quad Shot (4 lasersbeams)</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Battle waves of enemies </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UFO's!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drones!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect Coins! &amp; Buy Upgrades</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend coins to upgrade your total HP / abilities.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize Laser Colors</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend coins to customize your laser beam color \u00a0</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Endless Mode</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How many rounds can you survive?\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore and battle on a variety of\u00a0arenas</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379190/extras/add49d17cdbbd2b2b4052f53741c5449.avif?t=1745848299\" data-has-big width=800 height=424 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379190/extras/8eb7e7037b0550c78868721499a31c6f.avif?t=1745848299\" data-has-big width=800 height=442 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3379190/extras/f9dbdea0eaf3291aca7c6ce921201200.avif?t=1745848299\" data-has-big width=800 height=428 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
